        <section class="society_details">
          <div class="title">
            <h1>Neelyog Aashiyana B wing</h1>
            <p>Address: 3, Poisar Gymkhana Rd, Kandivali, Sunder Pada, Kandivali West</p>
          </div>

          <div class="description">
            <h2>Description</h2>
            <p class="truncate">
              Neelyog Aashiyana B wing - A Serene and Welcoming Society in the Heart of Mumbai<br><br>Welcome to Neelyog Aashiyana B wing, a vibrant residential society nestled in a prime location in Kandivali West, Mumbai. With its unrivaled location and a host of modern amenities, this society offers a comfortable and convenient living experience for residents of all ages. <br><br>Location:<br>Neelyog Aashiyana B wing is situated at 3, Poisar Gymkhana Rd, Kandivali, Sunder Pada, Kandivali West, Mumbai. Its strategic location ensures easy access to essential services such as schools, hospitals, shopping centers, and entertainment options. The society is well-connected to major transportation networks, making commuting hassle-free.<br><br>Residential Units:<br>With a total of 96 spacious and meticulously designed residential units, Neelyog Aashiyana B wing offers a variety of housing options to suit diverse preferences. These thoughtfully planned apartments provide ample natural light and ventilation, making them the ideal place to call home.<br><br>Occupancy Rate and Safety:<br>Neelyog Aashiyana B wing boasts an impressive occupancy rate of 83.33%, which speaks volumes about its popularity among families and individuals looking for a secure and peaceful living environment. The society takes safety seriously, employing more than 5-10 trained and vigilant guards who ensure round-the-clock security.<br><br>Amenities and Facilities:<br>This society goes the extra mile to provide a comfortable and enjoyable lifestyle to its residents. The premises are adorned with beautifully landscaped gardens, making it a serene oasis amidst the bustling city. The society also features a fully equipped gymnasium, a swimming pool, and a clubhouse where residents can unwind and socialize. <br><br>Notice Board and Daily Help:<br>Neelyog Aashiyana B wing maintains an active notice board, with more than 12 notices displayed regularly to keep residents updated about the latest happenings. The society is also known for having a large number of daily help profiles available, ranging from 40-60, making it convenient for residents to find the necessary assistance they require.<br><br>Reviews and Ratings:<br>The society has received positive feedback from its residents, with an average rating of 4.7 out of 5. This high rating is a testament to the society's commitment to providing top-notch facilities and services. Additionally, the dedicated daily help staff has garnered an impressive average rating of 4.13, ensuring that residents receive quality assistance when needed.<br><br>Ideal for All:<br>Neelyog Aashiyana B wing is an ideal living space for families, as it offers a secure environment conducive to raising children. The society is also pet-friendly, making it ideal for those with furry friends. Additionally, the community spirit and amenities available cater to the needs of elders in the society, fostering a comfortable and inclusive environment for everyone.<br><br>In conclusion, Neelyog Aashiyana B wing offers a harmonious blend of modern living and community spirit. Its unbeatable location, well-maintained premises, and excellent amenities make it a sought-after choice for those seeking a peaceful and convenient lifestyle in the heart of Mumbai.
            </p>
            <a id="readMore" class="link">Read more</a>
          </div>

